1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,577
In 2021, GM recalled every

2
00:00:03,677 --> 00:00:05,632
Chevy Bolt it had ever sold.

3
00:00:05,732 --> 00:00:07,241
The battery cells were faulty,

4
00:00:07,276 --> 00:00:10,160
and fixing them cost nearly two billion dollars.

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,688
Hyundai had to swap the batteries

6
00:00:11,722 --> 00:00:14,582
in eighty-two thousand cars.

7
00:00:14,882 --> 00:00:16,496
I'm Catalyst, and I check battery

8
00:00:16,542 --> 00:00:18,927
material long before it gets near a car.

9
00:00:19,027 --> 00:00:21,493
This is an anode under a microscope.

10
00:00:21,593 --> 00:00:23,199
Grey is graphite.

11
00:00:23,299 --> 00:00:24,604
Orange is silicon:

12
00:00:24,704 --> 00:00:26,306
it holds much more lithium,

13
00:00:26,387 --> 00:00:28,726
but it swells every charge.

14
00:00:28,826 --> 00:00:31,009
Blue is space for the lithium to move.

15
00:00:31,044 --> 00:00:33,912
If the mix drifts, so does the battery.

16
00:00:34,012 --> 00:00:35,479
When a new delivery comes in,

17
00:00:35,579 --> 00:00:37,453
check it against what the supplier promised.

18
00:00:37,553 --> 00:00:38,865
You'll see what's changed,

19
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,048
by how much, and how confident I am.

20
00:00:41,129 --> 00:00:42,329
You get a clear call:

21
00:00:42,429 --> 00:00:45,088
accept, investigate or reject.

22
00:00:45,123 --> 00:00:46,620
And I'll explain it in the right

23
00:00:46,655 --> 00:00:48,327
words for the operator, the engineer,

24
00:00:48,362 --> 00:00:50,455
the scientist and the manager.

25
00:00:51,155 --> 00:00:53,400
You can also drop in a single image.

26
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,870
I measure the silicon,

27
00:00:54,917 --> 00:00:56,438
the particles and the pores,

28
00:00:56,484 --> 00:00:58,411
then tell you which batch it looks like

29
00:00:58,446 --> 00:01:01,074
and how sure I am, with the reasons.

30
00:01:01,174 --> 00:01:02,927
If it doesn't look like anything

31
00:01:02,997 --> 00:01:05,680
I've seen before, I'll say so.

32
00:01:05,780 --> 00:01:07,189
Don't just take my word for it.

33
00:01:07,289 --> 00:01:09,344
Open any image and see exactly

34
00:01:09,391 --> 00:01:11,899
which pixels I counted as silicon.

35
00:01:11,999 --> 00:01:14,228
Every decision is logged with a fingerprint

36
00:01:14,263 --> 00:01:14,960
of its inputs,

37
00:01:14,994 --> 00:01:17,468
so anyone can check it later.

38
00:01:17,568 --> 00:01:18,583
Catalyst.

39
00:01:18,683 --> 00:01:20,285
Catch the bad batch at the factory,

40
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,799
before it makes the news.

41
00:01:21,899 --> 00:01:25,373
Made by Team Batch Size 2.
